Description: OWASP-oriented web directory and subdomain scanner
 OpenDoor is a terminal-based web reconnaissance tool for authorized
 security testing. It supports directory discovery, subdomain enumeration,
 fingerprinting, WAF detection, proxy and tunnel-aware scans, and multiple
 report formats.
